# {{non-gloss definition|animal sound of the puffin ({{l-lite|fo|lundi}})}}
: {{ux|fo|[[lundi]]n [[siga|sigur]] '''á á á'''|the puffin says "oh oh oh"}}

===Etymology 5===
From {{inh-lite|fo|non}}.

====Verb====
{{head|fo|verb}}

# {{inflection of|fo|eiga||archaic|3|pres}}

